#. Programme-only identifiers and raw option values retain their exact meanings.
msgctxt "#30258"
msgid "This pass is for the selected programme, not every episode of the series.\nPrepare this pass 1–48 hours before the programme starts, including either limit.\nThe rule matches exact series and programme identifiers (EQ.SeriesID + EQ.ProgramID). It has no Time condition.\nNo extra recording time. DVR values: KeepOnly is empty; KeepNum is 0; Rerecord is false; Limit is 0. These values are not given additional meanings here.\nThe preview has exactly one matching future airing. Later matches are not guaranteed.\nChannels DVR may use another available source.\nThe rule stays on the DVR after you exit Kodi.\nOnly this profile's pass, independently verified as this add-on's, can be removed.\nPreparing another pass requires verified removal of the previous pass. History is limited to 32 archived records and 8 MiB total.\nOnly Save archives the previous unchanged record together with the new operation record.\nOperation history is never removed or reset. No automatic Save, Remove or repeated change attempts."
msgstr ""

